{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-greenspoint","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"greenspoint-emaar-properties-emaar-south","about":"Greenspoint at Emaar South, Dubai, is the latest development by Emaar Properties, offering an exceptional collection of 3 and 4-bedroom townhouses. Nestled within a vibrant golf course community, this new address provides residents with abundant green spaces, community parks, and a range of lifestyle amenities. With biking trails and an adventure playground, Greenspoint Townhouses at Emaar South is the perfect place to embrace an active, family-friendly lifestyle.Greenspoint’s modern façade, in an earthy palette, seamlessly blends sophistication with nature. Lush green spaces enhance the connection to the outdoors, complementing interiors adorned with soft stone textures and natural wood finishes. Sunlit spaces and sleek fittings create an elegant, tranquil atmosphere.Ideally located, Greenspoint offers easy access to key destinations in Dubai, including Expo City Dubai, Al Maktoum International Airport, Downtown Dubai, and Dubai Marina, via major roads like Emirates Road and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road. For those seeking tranquility and convenience, Greenspoint by Emaar Properties presents an unparalleled living experience with flexible payment plans and world-class amenities.","price":3360000,"title":"Greenspoint","bitrix":{"id":1127,"pf_id":"are.3.14979","source":null,"project_id":"EMAAR South","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Greenspoint","property_type":"Townhouses","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Dubai South (Dubai World Central)"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Greenspoint_at_Emaar_South_Dubai_by_Emaar_Properties_524af2e6aa.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Greenspoint_at_Emaar_South_Dubai_by_Emaar_Properties_524af2e6aa.webp"}],"status":"pen